[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_02_0010","text":"甜花酱，辛苦了！\n第二弹也已经定下来了，到时候也请多关照！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_02_0020","text":"谢谢，您辛苦了……！\n下次，也会加油的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_02_0030","text":"嘿嘿……\n任务，完成……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_02_0040","text":"嗯，大成功呢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_02_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_02_0050","text":"…………唔喵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_02_0060","text":"（甜花，好像睡着了啊）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_02_0070","text":"……樱饼……\n甜甜的，但是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_02_0080","text":"叶子……\n咸咸的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_02_0090","text":"…………软软的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_02_0100","text":"（哈哈……在梦里\n　吃着樱饼呢……！）"}]
